# Owners for the files that decide how this repo is checked, reviewed and published, and for the
# source that decides what a wallet signs and where tokens go (.github/funds-safety.json and
# .github/security-review.md). Everything else has no owner on purpose. The last matching line wins.

# CI, the publish workflow, the agent instructions and this file.
/.github/                  @tao-com-official/devops
/AGENTS.md                 @tao-com-official/devops
/CLAUDE.md                 @tao-com-official/devops
/.claude/                  @tao-com-official/devops
/.agents/                  @tao-com-official/devops
/.gitleaks*                @tao-com-official/devops

# The SDK source: signing, sessions, tokens, amounts, errors and the public exports
# (.github/security-review.md puts all of src/ in scope; src/hotkeys.ts is in funds-safety.json).
/src/                      @tao-com-official/devops

# Dependencies and what ships to npm.
package.json               @tao-com-official/devops
package-lock.json          @tao-com-official/devops
/tsconfig.build.json       @tao-com-official/devops
